inct play style and roles, along with many vehicles to help save mother earth!\n\nI personally prefer balams over barga, but the battle with kaijus on barga felt satisfying as hell!", "timestamp_created": 1605803856, "timestamp_updated": 1605803856, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.498257845640182495", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "79485961", "author": {"steamid": "76561198148139017", "personaname": "Fat Kyle", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198148139017/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 7154, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3600, "last_played": 1651117007, "avatar": "c8c5e6bef59a39c051bbd77ec2c12a175b9eac23"}, "language": "english", "review": "Bug + Game = Game Bug. very gud yes. Had Very noice time killing bug. Bug is ded. yes.", "timestamp_created": 1605746731, "timestamp_updated": 1605746731, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.474452555179595947", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}]}